    "text": "Jackson County Pilot\nwebsite\nJackson\nGuest column: One year after the flood\nBy Jackson County Pilot Staff,\n17 hours agoOne year ago, our community faced one of the most devastating natural disasters in our history. The flood of June 2024 brought not only rising waters, but also fear, uncertainty and hardship. Today, we gather not just to remember what we endured, but to reflect on how far we’ve come, and how we came through it — together.",
